-- A session's change to a module is published to the served source when its command is done
-- (h-sync): before the first change to a module in a command, its pointer as the session had it is
-- kept (STORE/before/PATH), so the server can take the change only from that same pointer
h-before-of : List Word → List Word → List Word
h-before-of st path = list-append st (list-append "/before/" (h-hex path))
